cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  waveguide_scattering: 3-D analysis of scattering losses due to
  sidewall roughness in microphotonic waveguides
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper it implements
  (preferred-citation below).
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Barwicz
    given-names: Tymon
    affiliation: Massachusetts Institute of Technology
  - family-names: West
    given-names: Gavin
repository-code: https://github.com/gvnwst/barwicz-scattering-matlab
abstract: >-
  The original research code for the volume-current-method model of
  scattering loss from sidewall roughness in rectangular dielectric
  waveguides, valid at any index contrast and for either polarization,
  packaged with the datasets needed to reproduce the published results.
keywords:
  - integrated photonics
  - waveguide
  - scattering loss
  - sidewall roughness
  - volume current method
